sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant D as Dispatcher
    participant S as Job + result store
    participant W as Worker

    U->>D: Send a request
    D->>S: Record the job
    D->>W: Start one bounded task
    opt Dispatcher restarts before completion
        D->>S: Find unfinished work
        S-->>D: Return the recorded job
        D->>W: Restart the task
    end
    W->>S: Save result file
    S-->>D: Result file is ready
    D->>S: Record completion
    alt Routine answer
        D-->>U: Deliver answer to user or source
    else A decision is needed
        Note over D,S: Decision handoff to list
    end
